    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika na egetabu enke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkarora omomalaika onde bw’echinguru ogoika korwa igoro oboirie riire. Nigo arenge nomokubinyongo bw’embura oetanaine omotwe oye, na obosio bwaye nigo bwarenge buna erioba, na amagoro aye buna chisiiro chi’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narenge na egetabu egeke kiaigoire ase okoboko kwaye. Akabeka okogoro kwaye gw’okorio igoro ase enyancha na ogw’okobee igoro ase ense enyomo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akarera neriogi rinene ringa buna eri’endo ekoruma. Ekero achia korera chinkoba isano na ibere chigakwana neriogi riabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero chinkoba echio isano na ibere chiare goaka eriogi nkaba ang’e korika. Erio nkaigwa eriogi rikorwa igoro rigoteeba, “Mumeka amang’ana ayio atebwa ne chinkoba chiria isano na ibere, oyabeeke ekemanyerio, toyariika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omomalaika oria naroche oteneine ase enyancha na ase ense enyomo akaimokereria okoboko kwaye gw’okorio igoro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agatiana asere oyore moyo goika kare na kare, oyotongete igoro na ebinto bireo, na ense na ebinto bireo, na enyancha na ebinto bireo, agateeba, “Engaki ende tekoba magega ase aya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende ekero omomalaika o gatano na kabere arabugie egetureeri kiaye, obobisi bwa Nyasae naboikeranigwe, buna araareretie abasomba baye ababani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio eriogi riria naigwete korwa igoro riare gokwana nainche naende, rigateba, “Genda, obogorie egetabu eria eigoire ere ase okoboko kw’omomalaika oria oteneine ase enyancha na ase ense enyomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagenda ase omomalaika oria nkamoteebia, “Ing’a egetabu eyio enke.” Aganteebia, “Yebogorie, oyerie; ero nekobekere obororo ase enda yao, korende ase omonwa oo nebe enyansu buna obooke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabogoria egetabu eria enke korwa ase okoboko kw’omomalaika oria, nkayeria. Ase omonwa one ekaba enyansu buna obooke, korende ase enda yane ekambekera obororo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aganteebia, “Nekogwenerete obaane naende igoro ase abanto, na ebisaku, na emenwa, na abarwoti abange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
